{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "tunisbusiness-suite-api",
		"name": "TunisBusiness Suite API",
		"description": "Collection complète pour tester l'API TunisBusiness Suite - SaaS de gestion pour PME tunisiennes.\n\n## Authentification\nLa plupart des endpoints nécessitent un Bearer Token obtenu via `/api/login`.\n\n## Variables d'environnement\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:8000\n- `token`: Bearer token obtenu après login\n- `tenant_id`: ID du tenant actif\n\n## Comptes de test\n- **Starter**: admin@starter.tunisbusiness.tn / password\n- **Business**: admin@business.tunisbusiness.tn / password  \n- **Enterprise**: admin@enterprise.tunisbusiness.tn / password",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://localhost:8000",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('token', jsonData.token);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Test Company\",\n    \"email\": \"test@example.tn\",\n    \"password\": \"password\",\n    \"password_confirmation\": \"password\",\n    \"company_name\": \"Test Company SARL\",\n    \"plan\": \"business\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/register",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "register"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.environment.set('token', jsonData.token);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"admin@enterprise.tunisbusiness.tn\",\n    \"password\": \"password\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "login"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Current User",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/me",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "me"]
						}
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Logout",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/logout",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "logout"]
						}
					}
				}
			]
		},
